    "description": {
      "value": "This lustrous lute has a polished body that changes to show whatever decorations or carvings you find most appealing, or which best reinforce the story of the song you're currently playing (as a free action). Its frets are inlaid with mother of pearl. With its mix of enchantment and illusion magic, it's favored by many traveling minstrels. While playing the lute, you gain a +1 item bonus to Diplomacy and Performance checks. You expend a number of charges from this instrument to cast a spell from its list. The item bonuses are +2. glibness, infectious melody hallucination, illusory creature, illusory scene, suggestion"
    },
